ontology engineering
	"Physical production and modification of engineered artifacts."
	version 1.0
	using imod, infrastructure
	in domain imod:Engineering;

/**
 * ## Producing an assembled artifact
 *
 * ProductAssembly joins components to produce an artifact recognized as a new
 * entity. The product is distinct from the activity and from descriptions of its
 * design or acceptance. An intended function does not establish actual delivery.
 *
 * Joining or rejoining parts of a continuing artifact does not alone establish
 * production of a new one. Assembly that produces a new artifact is distinguished
 * here from modification of a continuing artifact. Observations and models
 * identify the participants and the criteria for the product's continuity.
 */
process ProductAssembly
    "Intentional joining of components to produce a new artifact entity."
    is infrastructure:ArtifactProduction;
